        "## 1. My lane (or freestyle) and why\n",
        "\n",
        "**Lane Choice: Lane 2 — Refresh / Content Opportunity Scoring**\n",
        "\n",
        "Organic search visibility is highly dynamic; once published, content items naturally decay as competitor pages update, keyword search behaviors shift, and content freshness scores decline. Human capacity to manually audit and update content is highly constrained. I have selected Lane 2 (Refresh / Content Opportunity Scoring) because prioritizing organic search pages that need editorial updates is a critical operational bottleneck. By building an evidence-based prioritization model, we can ensure that editors invest their time on pages where search console signals indicate both the highest severity of decay and the strongest search demand."
      ],
      "id": "kNxw8VKfzK4b"
